1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,600
@CafeMusicalScene

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:06,156
[Girl]{Voice:teasing}阿澈，再画下去，咖啡都凉了。

3
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:09,364
[Boy]{Voice:gentle}先别动。你的影子正好到这里。

4
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:11,672
[Girl]{Voice:teasing}我的影子都坐累了。

5
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:14,200
{Event:CeramicPickup}

6
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:15,556
[Girl]{Voice:bright}接一句？

7
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:17,822
[Boy]{Voice:gentle}唱还行，跳不会。

8
00:00:17,850 --> 00:00:19,000
{Event:SunlightPause}

9
00:00:19,000 --> 00:01:34,560
{Event:CafeDuet}

10
00:01:35,300 --> 00:01:37,032
[Girl]{Voice:teasing}不是说不会跳？

11
00:01:37,350 --> 00:01:39,082
[Boy]{Voice:gentle}我只跟了你半步。

12
00:01:39,500 --> 00:01:41,232
[Girl]{Voice:amused}咖啡真的凉了。

13
00:01:41,600 --> 00:01:43,332
[Boy]{Voice:gentle}正好，现在能喝了。

14
00:01:43,460 --> 00:01:47,500
{Event:CafeCoda}
